WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Welcome to RehearsAI!
If you're a theatre director,

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:07.280
acting coach, filmmaker, or anyone 
working with dialogue based scripts,

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:13.400
RehearsAI can dramatically simplify the way you 
prepare, organize, and manage your projects.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.480
In this video, we'll explore the Windows version 
of RehearsAI and learn how to create a project,

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:24.680
organize characters, edit scripts, manage 
scenes, and prepare everything before sharing

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:28.560
your project with your cast.
Let's get started.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:32.840
going Before using RehearsAI, 
you'll need to create an account

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.880
When you first open the application, 
you'll see the RehearsAI

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:37.640
welcome screen.
here you should

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.560
enter your email address
and create a password.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:43.520
Make sure you use a real email 
address that you can access,

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:47.960
because you'll need it if you ever need to 
reset your password and get access to your

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:52.000
projects.
Once you've entered your details, click Sign Up.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.960
Your account will then be created, 
and you'll be able to start

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:58.320
using RehearsAI and save your 
projects to your account.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.600
after signing up, you'll be 
taken into the main RehearsAI

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:07.920
workspace. before creating your first project
let's take a quick look at the Settings page.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.800
RehearsAI currently supports multiple languages,

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:15.560
allowing users from different countries to 
work comfortably in their preferred language.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:19.240
You can easily change the 
application language from this menu.

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:24.640
You'll also find your account 
information and helpful usage tips,

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:30.920
including your monthly AI character allowance.
The free version allows one AI extraction of

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:35.920
up to 200,000 characters, making it 
perfect for testing the application.

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:39.920
Premium users can process up to 
two million characters every month.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.800
If you ever encounter a problem,

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:48.760
you can quickly contact support or submit 
a bug report directly from the application.

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:55.480
For privacy and transparency, RehearsAI 
also includes a Delete All My Data option,

00:01:55.480 --> 00:02:00.440
allowing you to permanently remove all of your 
information from the server whenever you choose.

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:05.560
Now let's create our first project.
Click New Project, enter a project name,

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:08.520
and press Create.
There are two ways to start.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.200
You can either Paste a Script 
or Upload a Script File.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:16.760
If you're new to RehearsAI, I recommend starting 
with Upload a Script File. It's the easiest way

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:21.720
to import an existing theatrical script and 
get familiar with how the application works.

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:21.861
We'll cover the Paste Script 
option later in this tutorial,

00:02:21.861 --> 00:02:24.760
including how it works and when to use it.
For this demonstration, we'll upload a script.

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:32.520
RehearsAI uses AI to analyze your script and 
automatically separate each character's dialogue.

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:35.200
After selecting the file, 
simply enter the character

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:36.854
names found in the script.
Once everything is ready,

00:02:36.854 --> 00:02:40.080
click Start AI Extraction.
Within seconds, the AI analyzes the document and

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:46.280
automatically separates each character's dialogue.
Even scripts containing over one hundred pages

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:51.240
can usually be processed in less than a minute, 
saving an enormous amount of manual work.

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:58.200
Once processing is complete, you'll immediately 
see every character and all of their dialogue.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:01.720
The AI is highly accurate, but 
it's always recommended to review

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:05.800
the results before rehearsals begin.
One of the biggest advantages of the

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:11.240
Windows version is the View Full Script feature.
Unlike the mobile versions, Windows lets you

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:15.480
display the complete original script 
alongside your extracted dialogue.

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:19.360
This makes reviewing, correcting, 
and editing incredibly fast.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:25.120
If you notice that a line belongs to another 
character, or a dialogue wasn't extracted

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:29.680
correctly, simply edit it directly.
Everything updates instantly.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:34.720
RehearsAI also gives you 
complete control over your cast.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.320
You can rename characters.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:40.280
merge multiple characters into one.
add brand-new characters.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:45.680
or remove characters that are no longer needed.
You can even insert new dialogue at any position

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:49.440
inside the script or append it to 
the end of a character's lines.

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:54.360
This makes the Windows version an ideal 
editing environment before rehearsals begin.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:04:00.600
Large scripts can become difficult to navigate.
That's why RehearsAI includes a powerful

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.040
search function.
Simply type a word,

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:08.840
phrase, or character name, and instantly jump 
to every matching location inside the script.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:13.440
Another extremely useful 
feature is Scene Management.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:17.080
Instead of scrolling through hundreds 
of dialogue lines, you can divide

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:21.480
the script into individual scenes.
Each scene can be renamed, reordered,

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:26.720
updated, or deleted whenever necessary.
This makes rehearsals much more organized,

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:30.000
allowing actors to practice 
only the scenes they need.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.520
Once your project is fully 
edited, it's time to share it.

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:38.560
Click Share Project.
RehearsAI uploads your project securely to

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:43.480
the server and generates a unique project code.
Simply send this code to your actors.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:47.720
From the Android or iPhone application, 
they can join the rehearsal by entering

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:54.760
the code and selecting their assigned characters.
As the project owner, you remain in full control.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:05:01.560
You can lock or unlock the project at any time, 
remove participants, or block users if necessary.

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:06.920
Any edits you make in the Windows application can 
also be synchronized back to the shared project.

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:13.360
Finally, RehearsAI allows you to export your work.
You can export the complete script.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:16.520
or generate scripts containing 
only selected characters.

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:21.720
This is perfect for printing rehearsal copies or 
sharing personalized dialogue with each actor.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:26.440
RehearsAI for Windows is designed to be 
your complete project management workspace.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:30.840
From AI-powered dialogue extraction.
to advanced editing.

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:33.120
scene organization.
project sharing.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:36.240
and script exporting.
everything is built to save time

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:39.200
and make rehearsals more efficient.
Thank you for watching.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:43.840
In the next video, we'll explore the Android and 
iPhone versions and see how actors can rehearse

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:47.520
their roles anywhere, anytime.
See you in the next tutorial.
